  "title": "Firefly Aerospace Announces Formation of Advisory Board",
  "summary": "CEDAR PARK, Texas, July 23, 2018 /PRNewswire/ — Firefly Aerospace, Inc. (Firefly), a developer of orbital launch vehicles for the small to medium satellite market, announced today the formation of an all-star advisory board. Members of the board act as ambassadors and advocates of Firefly and support the executive and management teams through consultation and...",
